{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-guardian#card-zh","repo":"akira399/dsh-guardian","commit":"5bf7ef3ad56d5e0b78e40071ac99d94b697e468b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-guardian（DSH 插件，web 等客户端）：为 DSH 会话提供任务过程防护。它通过 agent 与 session 事件跟踪运行状态，并注册状态查询路由。主要功能包括扫描插件 inject 声明、识别重复工具调用、限制子代理或工作流嵌套深度，以及报告会话是否适合重启。适合需要检查插件服务声明或观察任务循环与递归情况的 DSH 管理者。使用前需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本；可选配置 guardian 参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:165-240","lib/index.js:242-280","lib/preflight.js:56-100"]}
{"unit_id":"akira399__dsh-guardian#card-en","repo":"akira399/dsh-guardian","commit":"5bf7ef3ad56d5e0b78e40071ac99d94b697e468b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-guardian is a DSH plugin that scans inject declarations, detects repeated tool calls, limits nested workflows or subagents, and reports session status through a web route. It helps DSH operators monitor task loops and recursion. Requires Node.js 20 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:165-240","lib/index.js:242-280","lib/preflight.js:56-100"]}
